#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:2
msgid "(Optional) Set up TLS"
msgstr "(선택) TLS 설정"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:4
msgid "You have two options if you want users to connect with HTTPS:"
msgstr "사용자가 HTTPS로 연결하도록 하려면 두 가지 옵션이 있습니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:6
msgid ""
":doc:`Install a proxy such as NGINX </deployment-guide/server/setup-"
"nginx-proxy>` and then `set up TLS on the proxy <#Use-TLS-on-NGINX-"
"as-a-proxy>`__. This is our recommended option if you have a large number"
" of users (more than 200), or if you want to use a reverse proxy for "
"other reasons, such as load balancing or caching. A proxy server delivers"
" better performance and provides standard HTTP request logs."
msgstr ""
":doc:`NGINX 같은 프록시를 설치 </deployment-guide/server/setup-nginx-"
"proxy>`\\ 한 다음 `프록시에 TLS를 설정 <#Use-TLS-on-NGINX-as-a-proxy>`__\\ "
"합니다. 사용자가 많거나(200명 초과) 로드 밸런싱·캐싱 등 다른 이유로 리버스 "
"프록시를 사용하려는 경우 권장하는 옵션입니다. 프록시 서버는 더 나은 성능을 "
"제공하고 표준 HTTP 요청 로그를 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:8
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if you have fewer than 200 users, you can set up TLS on "
"Mattermost server. This is the easiest option when you don't need to use "
"a reverse proxy."
msgstr ""
"또는 사용자가 200명 미만이면 OKR.BEST 서버에 TLS를 설정할 수 있습니다. 리버스 "
"프록시를 사용할 필요가 없을 때 가장 쉬운 옵션입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:10
msgid ""
"You can use `Let's Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ to automatically"
" install and set up the certificate."
msgstr ""
"`Let's Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__\\ 를 사용해 인증서를 자동으로 "
"설치하고 설정할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:11
msgid "You can also specify your own certificate."
msgstr "직접 인증서를 지정할 수도 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:12
msgid ""
"You can use a self-signed certificate, but this is not recommended for "
"production environments."
msgstr ""
"자체 서명 인증서를 사용할 수 있지만, 프로덕션 환경에서는 권장되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:15
msgid "Configure TLS on the Mattermost server"
msgstr "OKR.BEST 서버에 TLS 구성"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:17
msgid "In **System Console > Environment > Web Server**:"
msgstr "**관리자 도구 > 환경 > 웹서버**\\ 에서:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:19
msgid "Change the **Listen Address** setting to ``:443``."
msgstr "**Listen Address** 설정을 ``:443``\\ 으로 변경합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:20
msgid "Change the **Connection Security** setting to ``TLS``."
msgstr "**Connection Security** 설정을 ``TLS``\\ 로 변경합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:21
msgid "Change the **Forward port 80 to 443** setting to ``true``."
msgstr "**Forward port 80 to 443** 설정을 ``true``\\ 로 변경합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:23
msgid ""
"Activate the ``CAP_NET_BIND_SERVICE`` capability to allow Mattermost to "
"bind to low ports:"
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST가 낮은 포트에 바인딩할 수 있도록 ``CAP_NET_BIND_SERVICE`` 기능을 "
"활성화합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:29
msgid ""
"Install the security certificate. Use Let's Encrypt to automatically "
"install and setup the certificate, or specify your own certificate."
msgstr ""
"보안 인증서를 설치합니다. Let's Encrypt를 사용해 인증서를 자동으로 설치·설정"
"하거나, 직접 인증서를 지정합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:32
msgid "Use a Let's Encrypt certificate"
msgstr "Let's Encrypt 인증서 사용"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:34
msgid ""
"The certificate is retrieved the first time that a client tries to "
"connect to the Mattermost server. Certificates are retrieved for any "
"hostname a client tries to reach the server at."
msgstr ""
"인증서는 클라이언트가 OKR.BEST 서버에 처음 연결을 시도할 때 가져옵니다. "
"인증서는 클라이언트가 서버에 접근하려는 모든 호스트 이름에 대해 가져옵니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:36
msgid "Change the **Use Let's Encrypt** setting to ``true``."
msgstr "**Use Let's Encrypt** 설정을 ``true``\\ 로 변경합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:37
#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:50
msgid "Restart the Mattermost server for these changes to take effect."
msgstr "이러한 변경 사항을 적용하려면 OKR.BEST 서버를 다시 시작합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:41
msgid ""
"If Let's Encrypt is enabled, forward port 80 through a firewall, with "
":ref:`Forward80To443 <administration-guide/configure/environment-"
"configuration-settings:forward port 80 to 443>` ``config.json`` setting "
"set to ``true`` to complete the Let's Encrypt certification."
msgstr ""
"Let's Encrypt가 활성화된 경우, Let's Encrypt 인증을 완료하려면 :ref:`"
"Forward80To443 <administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-"
"settings:forward port 80 to 443>` ``config.json`` 설정을 ``true``\\ 로 "
"설정한 상태에서 방화벽을 통해 80번 포트를 포워딩하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:42
msgid ""
"Your Mattermost server must be accessible from the Let's Encrypt CA in "
"order to verify your domain name and issue the certificate. Be sure to "
"open your firewall and configure any reverse proxies to forward traffic "
"to ports 80 and 443. More information can be found `at Let's Encrypt "
"<https://letsencrypt.org/how-it-works/>`_."
msgstr ""
"도메인 이름을 확인하고 인증서를 발급하려면 OKR.BEST 서버가 Let's Encrypt "
"CA에서 접근 가능해야 합니다. 방화벽을 열고 모든 리버스 프록시가 80번과 443번 "
"포트로 트래픽을 포워딩하도록 구성하세요. 자세한 내용은 `Let's Encrypt "
"<https://letsencrypt.org/how-it-works/>`_\\ 에서 확인할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:45
msgid "Use your own certificate"
msgstr "직접 인증서 사용"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:47
msgid "Change the **Use Let's Encrypt** setting to ``false``."
msgstr "**Use Let's Encrypt** 설정을 ``false``\\ 로 변경합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:48
msgid ""
"Change the **TLS Certificate File** setting to the location of the "
"certificate file."
msgstr "**TLS Certificate File** 설정을 인증서 파일의 위치로 변경합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:49
msgid ""
"Change the **TLS Key File** setting to the location of the private key "
"file."
msgstr "**TLS Key File** 설정을 개인 키 파일의 위치로 변경합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:54
msgid "Password-protected certificates aren't supported."
msgstr "비밀번호로 보호된 인증서는 지원되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:57
msgid "Use TLS on NGINX (as a proxy)"
msgstr "NGINX(프록시)에서 TLS 사용"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:61
msgid ""
"Do not set up TLS on Mattermost before doing so for NGINX. It breaks the "
"connection as the TLS prevents it from successfully communicating with "
"the Mattermost server."
msgstr ""
"NGINX에 TLS를 설정하기 전에 OKR.BEST에 먼저 TLS를 설정하지 마세요. TLS가 "
"OKR.BEST 서버와의 정상적인 통신을 막아 연결이 끊깁니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:63
msgid ""
"NGINX will act as a forward proxy to encrypt the traffic between the "
"client and Mattermost server. After installing the SSL certificate, the "
"incoming traffic will be handled via NGINX on port 443 exposed to the "
"internet, proxy to the Mattermost server running on port 80."
msgstr ""
"NGINX는 클라이언트와 OKR.BEST 서버 간 트래픽을 암호화하는 포워드 프록시 역할을 "
"합니다. SSL 인증서를 설치하면 인터넷에 노출된 443번 포트의 NGINX를 통해 "
"인바운드 트래픽이 처리되어 80번 포트에서 실행 중인 OKR.BEST 서버로 "
"프록시됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:64
msgid ""
"(Optional) Upstream encryption between NGINX to Mattermost server is "
"allowed."
msgstr "(선택) NGINX와 OKR.BEST 서버 간 업스트림 암호화가 허용됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:65
msgid ""
"Follow `NGINX's guide on setting up SSL Termination for TCP Upstream "
"Servers <https://docs.nginx.com/nginx/admin-guide/security-controls"
"/terminating-ssl-tcp/>`__."
msgstr ""
"`TCP 업스트림 서버용 SSL 종료 설정에 대한 NGINX 가이드 "
"<https://docs.nginx.com/nginx/admin-guide/security-controls/terminating-"
"ssl-tcp/>`__\\ 를 따르세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:67
msgid "More helpful resources:"
msgstr "유용한 추가 리소스:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:69
msgid "`NGINX's SSL blog <https://www.f5.com/company/blog/nginx/nginx-ssl/>`_"
msgstr "`NGINX SSL 블로그 <https://www.f5.com/company/blog/nginx/nginx-ssl/>`_"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/setup-tls.rst:70
msgid ""
"`NGINX's SSL guide <https://docs.nginx.com/nginx/admin-guide/security-"
"controls/terminating-ssl-http/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`NGINX SSL 가이드 <https://docs.nginx.com/nginx/admin-guide/security-"
"controls/terminating-ssl-http/>`_"

